        {
          "text": "Abo bafise ubushobozi bgo gukinga ijuru, ngw imvura ntikoroke mu misi yo kuvugishwa kwabo: kandi bafise ubushobozi ku mazi kuyahindura amaraso no kubabarisha isi icago cose, uko bagomvye. ",
