          "text": "Kand’ amahanga araraka, uburake bgawe buraza, igihe co guciramw’ amateka abapfuye kirashika, n’ico kugereramw’ abasavyi bawe, ni bo bavugishwa nawe, no kugerera abera n’abubaha izina ryawe, aboroshe n’abahambaye, n’ico guhonerezamw’ abahonnya isi.",
